# Prettier also skips what the ROOT .gitignore lists (node_modules/, .venv/, ...),
# but not nested .gitignore files, so the apps' build output is listed here.
**/.next/
**/out/
apps/web/next-env.d.ts
# packages/e2e's own static export (MYAPP_WEB_DIST_DIR, docs/testing.md), left on disk by
# every `pnpm e2e` run.
apps/web/dist-e2e/
# Python is formatted by ruff, TOML and SQL aren't Prettier's.
pnpm-lock.yaml
# Rewritten by `next dev`; formatting it would churn.
apps/web/AGENTS.md
# Generated by Tauri and Cargo.
apps/desktop/src-tauri/gen/
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target/
# Written by `supabase link` and branching.
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/
# Generated by packages/tokens/build.mjs; `pnpm lint` fails when they are out of date.
packages/tokens/dist/
apps/cli/src/myapp/theme.json
# Storybook's static build (`pnpm build:storybook`).
packages/ui/storybook-static/
# apps/docs: Fumadocs MDX's generated type-safe source, next-env.d.ts, and the reference
# pages generated at build time (apps/docs/scripts) -- never committed.
apps/docs/.source/
apps/docs/next-env.d.ts
apps/docs/.generated/
apps/docs/content/docs/reference/api/
apps/docs/content/docs/reference/cli.mdx
apps/docs/content/docs/reference/mcp-tools.mdx
# The committed OpenAPI contract and its generated TS types (docs/architecture.md,
# `pnpm contract:generate`/`contract:check`): apps/api/scripts/export_openapi.py and
# openapi-typescript each own their own deterministic formatting (2-space-indent JSON
# with one array element per line, and openapi-typescript's own 4-space TS style) --
# reformatting either to Prettier's own style would just be undone by the next
# `pnpm contract:generate`, and `contract:check` compares against that exact output.
apps/api/openapi.json
packages/api-types/src/schema.d.ts
